  "identityStatus": "The native named precinct, stupa footprint, mapped hall roofs and the label points for the museum and Jade Hall establish the standing site. The larger east-facing hall beside the stupa matches the official three-by-five-bay ordination hall. The separate distant generic chapel label was excluded.",
